{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "8c3598bb7fba1ba82c721cbbcb251b93eba1fbdd514c413b018040a9690ab6d4", "ja": "ワクワクなステージ！", "zh": "雀跃期待的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "455654841c92ea13489843fc5ffc70bc4947a934853a7930b878d1cc82f48777", "ja": "リリースイベント当日。本番が楽しみで\n仕方がないやよい達。流れ星の思い出が、\n気持ちをいっそう高めていた。\nその幸せをみんなに伝えようと、\n4人はファンが待つステージに向かう。", "zh": "发片活动当天，弥生等人对正式演出抱着满心\n期待，看流星的回忆更让她们情绪高涨。\n四人朝粉丝等待的舞台前进，\n打算将这份幸福传递给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "99f6751397122fcdad1830608e7bf8a884ffb71ba410769874b4c18e912095f4", "ja": "（流れ星を見た後のレコーディングは、4人の声の張り\nがまるで違う、見違えるような出来に終わった！）", "zh": "（看了流星之后，四人在录音时展现出的张力\n截然不同，有了令人耳目一新的结果！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ee7702a772c77f5bdd07a6f2d7efdb0fb51ff4b374ae6b44caf0e427b5069def", "ja": "（そして、いよいよ迎えたCDリリース公演初日。\n劇場発の新曲披露とあって、注目度も高いようだ）", "zh": "（接着终于迎来CD发片公演首日。\n由于将会演唱剧场发行的新歌，似乎备受瞩目。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "edefa836b9b6b4ede02cc8ea7c4fa6fae4bf4c491cd3a55433ac5393b154fec4", "ja": "ららら～♪　本番まだかな、待ちきれない～♪\n一日千秋～、先週はずっと練習～♪", "zh": "啦啦啦～♪正式演出还没到吗，等不及了～♪\n一日千秋～上周一直都在练习～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "e75a8116e84e3987b603ec22ad3492bb663ddc67930a5233475c3c5b4f1f8b83", "ja": "えへへっ、私も早く歌いたいかもっ。\nまだかなー、まだかなー♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，我也希望可以快点唱歌。\n还没到吗──还没到吗──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "8fee98664d41b4860021194a42d60b02b2e71dea9c7cd11910d2a62e790d3d31", "ja": "おやぶんおやぶん！\nたまき、もう待ちきれない！", "zh": "老大老大！\n环已经等不及了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "f38063a8935ce873ccb6e5625849db0e146d54cf4a0b11b3f4eb7f1ba44226ae", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お客さんは、いっぱい\n来てくれた？　わたし、たくさんの人に聞いてほしい！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，今天有很多观众来吗？\n我想唱给很多很多人听！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7751ac2194363511821e21725a2f08ff83e655bae36d6dcc6c3e8dc0235c2aa4", "ja": "ああ、満員だ。みんな、気合い充分みたいだな。\n緊張はしていないか？", "zh": "是啊，客满了。\n大家看起来都干劲十足呢，不会紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "a0dc0dfeddcd3d1ac99ef1c5052095c81981ba9214391d3d03bda94bb57502ff", "ja": "してるんですけど、でも不思議なんですっ。\nちょっとドキドキしても……。", "zh": "虽然会紧张，可是很神奇喔！\n就算心跳得有点快……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "3fa9ae2c00ee9f0bad05bbf90c17ae00708c34be85526b2ee9a68f780395a6b8", "ja": "みんなで星を見た夜を思い出したら、\n胸がフワフワ～、ポカポカ～ってなって！", "zh": "只要想起大家一起看星星的夜晚，\n心中就会轻飘飘～暖洋洋～的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "9eaf41bded6e0e451ebb92a59c81186bd9d2be6394821c1e18aa01a2c30b06e7", "ja": "私も！　流れ星の歌だって思うだけで、\nすぐにあの夜と同じ気持ちになるんだよっ！", "zh": "我也是！一想到要唱流星的歌，\n马上就会找回那天晚上的心情呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "757be6506ef6755dd4feff8b24568bc1ba7fa601fd13faf367e108dfc70cdc84", "ja": "2回目のレコーディングの時も楽しかったですー。\n曲が流れたら、自然と星空がぶわわーって……。", "zh": "第二次录音的时候也好开心──\n一听到音乐，自然而然就想起星空……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cacfb7be933b4c205e081e8c01e29ed0da64abb74074898056e9876e901f2906", "ja": "そういえば、音響監督さんも言ってたな。みんなの歌っ\nてる姿を見てたら、いつの間にか笑顔になってたって。", "zh": "这么说来，音效指导也有说呢，\n他说看着大家唱歌的模样，就会不知不觉露出笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "ef17f5def49bb8a7022a1fe5a824fc62a439b6f70d6ad7d1537809680655c242", "ja": "くふふ、監督さんも、いっしょにいけたらよかったね♪", "zh": "呵呵，要是音效指导也有一起去就好了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "273eaf5e4cff05304e201508b350f618715181b1baf6e8c81178f87c8a0abad6", "ja": "それよりみんな、もうすぐ公演がはじまるよ！\nレコーディングの時みたいに、しっかりがんばろうね！", "zh": "话说回来，各位，公演马上就要开始了喔！\n大家要像录音的时候一样，好好加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "f5ee487c503c54c046ec3e7f5d3264c37b32fdd6d5b4145e37826555c8ee1953", "ja": "うんっ、頑張……ふわぁ～……。", "zh": "嗯，会加油……呼啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "4b6fb2d488548aec35d67134768bc90d5a6cddae9df26069d1c07cc5b2c0cb9d", "ja": "わぁ、大きなあくび～！", "zh": "哇，好大的呵欠～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "3479e08261cb6c1a3fa2fe6e543d75a60a21bfd23a4a95f596efccb0f42559e7", "ja": "もしかして可奈ちゃん、\n昨日あまり寝てないの？", "zh": "可奈，该不会你昨天\n都没什么睡吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "2ef27583c6ee34c9178b25ed50a3cd8468134b643b4d2e29bd5f4c3b3e89f53e", "ja": "うん、実は、昨日は楽しみすぎて、\n夜もずっと歌ってたから……ふわぁ～……えへへ。", "zh": "嗯，其实我昨天实在太期待了，\n就唱了一整晚的歌……呵啊……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "33ab2e0941f61c3e81c7e67db8e71b36e2a4ebaf35c8e513697f87cde05cca02", "ja": "おいおい、可奈、大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "喂喂，可奈，你没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "ab01f422eadfc93cd1fbb83dc6eaf77325ee1295b65f5f770f6bf1da3f6d713f", "ja": "だ、大丈夫です～！\n歌い始めたら、目が覚めますっ！", "zh": "没、没问题的～！\n只要开始唱歌就会醒过来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "9ce650fb25b29a8e6389ce594aa2d01033108a6452821c0d628b882956f5dc48", "ja": "それじゃ、可奈ちゃんの目を覚ますためにも……\nみんなでいつものアレをやろうー！", "zh": "那也为了让可奈醒来……\n我们来做平常那个吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "a4bc4a489f8f06f9bc8073d071ee00e6b7e9d27e2e4d142adf719b01b3e4290f", "ja": "それじゃ、いっくよー！\n765プロー、ファイト～っ！", "zh": "那就开始啰──！\n765艺能～Fight～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "94833bfd7e81a5b1f04639db9f81c0daf02a529b66ff0d1b84efefd75cf7910e", "ja": "ふぁあ～……。", "zh": "呵啊啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1025_005yay", "source_sha256": "368a7d311fe2221bb79451efa52158dd497bf5a4d39fd0f04ed5065087c3574e", "ja": "はわっ！　可奈ちゃん！？", "zh": "哇！可奈！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "eb2ecfcf9e0be7da255ef1b5831e2b83966d1ee103ce5084f59dd8c5ffd2a7e0", "ja": "ううっ、ごめんなさい……はうぅ……。", "zh": "呜呜，对不起……哈呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "23094449b1d1bff56bb2d84a7b7cd97d6e03a10211250f26e096bf113a1bf607", "ja": "はは、仕方ないな。でもそろそろ時間だから、\n次でビシッと決めてくれよ。元気よく、な！", "zh": "哈哈，真没办法。但时间也差不多了，\n接下来要呈现出完美的演出喔，拿出活力来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1028_005yay", "source_sha256": "091de8206cc759dfbe90a84854a96fe01be633b3f34355ce47aa1e2e2c08d4a5", "ja": "はい、わかりましたー！　みんな、今度こそいくよ？\n765プロー、ファイト～……！", "zh": "是的，我明白了！大家这次要认真来了喔。\n765艺能，Fight……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1029_005yay", "source_sha256": "31d6438d76b62192df592ac2b04fcecb91fd7354d3d1059e133aaa40a3f941b1", "ja": "オー！", "zh": "喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "31d6438d76b62192df592ac2b04fcecb91fd7354d3d1059e133aaa40a3f941b1", "ja": "オー！", "zh": "喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "31d6438d76b62192df592ac2b04fcecb91fd7354d3d1059e133aaa40a3f941b1", "ja": "オー！", "zh": "喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "31d6438d76b62192df592ac2b04fcecb91fd7354d3d1059e133aaa40a3f941b1", "ja": "オー！", "zh": "喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1033_005yay", "source_sha256": "647aa2015b0193880dab11769631899e6179b6cccc75a17e157d49d663adf2b0", "ja": "それじゃ、{$P$}も！\nいつもの、お願いしまーす！", "zh": "那{$P$}也是！\n麻烦你做平常那个了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_06_1034_p", "source_sha256": "0e23a250c411dcab1fef7ba72abfdd2382bfe57e24e72d8782bc9e788bdcf36b", "ja": "よし、いつものだな。それっ！", "zh": "好，平常的是吧，来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
